
### Access grpc services through http
POST http://localhost:8080/helloworld.srv/Helloworld.Call
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":"Oscar" }


###  View service nodes
GET http://localhost:8080/helloworld.srv/nodes


###  View service nodes
GET http://localhost:8080/stock/nodes



### Access stock grpc services through http
POST http://localhost:8080/stock/Stock.Quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "GOOGL"
}


### Create Note
POST http://localhost:8080/notes/Notes.Create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Note 2",
  "text": "This is my note 2"
}

### List Notes
POST http://localhost:8080/notes/Notes.List
Content-Type: application/json

{

}

### Read a Note
POST http://localhost:8080/notes/Notes.Read
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "f4d9843e-d179-11ef-ba6a-4ebfde4e0a71"
}